      "title": "haiku-setup: improvements/fixes for --install-optional.",
      "message": "haiku-setup: improvements/fixes for --install-optional.\n\nJust install lua_devel; we don't need to look for a particular one.\n\nJust install libssh_devel; we don't need to search for libssh-devl and\nlbissh-gcrypt-dev.\n\nIt's libmaxminddb_devel, not maxminddb_devel.\n\nInstall minzip_ng_devel and zlib_ng_devel.\n\nminizip_ng_devel requires liblzma, which is provided by xz_utils.\n\nThe package with the SBC codecs is sbc_devel.\n\nThere is no nghttp3 package.\n\nThere is no ILBC package.\n\nThere is no BCG729 package.\n\nThere is no libcpuinfo package.\n\nThere is no advancecomp package.\n",
      "author_name": "Guy Harris",
      "author_email": "gharris@sonic.net",
      "authored_date": "2026-06-21T01:46:19.000-07:00",
